@startuml export-rules-json-dependency
!theme plain
title ルールJSONエクスポート機能 - コンポーネント依存・データフロー図

' NOTE:
' 本図は docs-rules/design.md で定義される
' 「user-stories 用アローダイアグラム（タスク依存ネットワーク図）」ではなく、
' Export Rules JSON 機能のコンポーネント依存・データフローを示す設計用ドキュメントです。
' user-stories 側の 04-network-diagram.puml とは目的が異なります。

' === Rules Page コンテキスト ===

' Layer 4: frameworks-and-drivers (UI)
rectangle "ExportButton\n(Atom)" as ExportBtn #LightBlue
rectangle "RulesApp\n(View)" as View #LightBlue
rectangle "useExportRulesJson\n(Hook)" as Hook #LightBlue
rectangle "ToastNotification\n(Molecule)" as Toast #LightBlue

' Layer 3: interface-adapters
rectangle "IExportRulesJson\nControllerFactory\n(Interface)" as IFactory #LightGreen
rectangle "ExportRulesJson\nControllerFactory" as Factory #LightGreen
rectangle "IExportRulesJson\nController\n(Interface)" as IController #LightGreen
rectangle "ExportRulesJson\nController" as Controller #LightGreen
rectangle "ExportRulesJson\nPresenter" as Presenter #LightGreen
rectangle "RewriteRuleMapper\n(既存)" as Mapper #LightGreen
rectangle "IRewriteRule\nMessagingPort\n(既存 Interface)" as IMessagingPort #LightGreen

' Layer 2: application-business-rules
rectangle "IExportRulesJson\nUseCase\n(Input Port)" as IUseCase #LightYellow
rectangle "IExportRulesJson\nPresenter\n(Output Port)" as IPresenter #LightYellow
rectangle "ExportRulesJson\nInteractor" as Interactor #LightYellow
rectangle "IRewriteRule\nRepository\n(既存 Gateway)" as IRepository #LightYellow
rectangle "ExportRulesJson\nInputData" as InputData #LightYellow
rectangle "ExportRulesJson\nOutputData" as OutputData #LightYellow

' Layer 1: enterprise-business-rules
rectangle "RewriteRule\n(Entity, 既存)" as Entity #LightPink

' Layer 4: frameworks-and-drivers (Infrastructure)
rectangle "ChromeRuntime\nRewriteRule\nRepository\n(既存)" as ChromeRepo #LightCyan
rectangle "RewriteRule\nMessagingService\n(既存)" as MessagingService #LightCyan
rectangle "DI Container" as Container #LightCyan

' Background Script
rectangle "RewriteRule\nProxyService\n(既存)" as ProxyService #LightGray
rectangle "DexieRewriteRule\nRepository\n(既存)" as DexieRepo #LightGray

' === 依存関係 ===

' View → Hook → Factory → Controller → UseCase
View --> ExportBtn : render
View --> Hook : 状態管理委譲
View --> Toast : エラー表示
Hook --> IFactory : resolve & create
IFactory --> Factory : implements
Factory --> Controller : creates
Factory --> Presenter : creates
Factory --> Interactor : creates
IController --> Controller : implements
Controller --> IUseCase : execute(inputData)

' Controller → DTOs
Controller --> InputData : creates

' Interactor → Ports
IUseCase --> Interactor : implements
Interactor --> IPresenter : present(outputData)
Interactor --> IRepository : getAll()
Interactor --> OutputData : creates
IPresenter --> Presenter : implements

' Presenter → View (callback)
Presenter --> View : triggerDownload\n(callback, ADR-005)

' Repository chain (既存フロー)
IRepository --> ChromeRepo : implements
ChromeRepo --> Mapper : getAll()
Mapper --> IMessagingPort : getAll()
IMessagingPort --> MessagingService : implements
MessagingService --> ProxyService : messaging
ProxyService --> DexieRepo : getAll()

' DI Container
Container --> Factory : registers
Container --> ChromeRepo : registers

' Entity (データフロー)
DexieRepo --> Entity : DTO → Entity変換\n(Mapper経由)

legend right
  |= 色 |= 層 |
  | <#LightBlue> | frameworks-and-drivers (UI) |
  | <#LightGreen> | interface-adapters |
  | <#LightYellow> | application-business-rules |
  | <#LightPink> | enterprise-business-rules |
  | <#LightCyan> | frameworks-and-drivers (Infrastructure) |
  | <#LightGray> | Background Script |
endlegend

note bottom
**ルールJSONエクスポート機能**

**アーキテクチャ**: Clean Architecture + Presenter Pattern (ADR-001)
**メッセージング**: @webext-core/proxy-service (ADR-002)
**DB アクセス**: messaging 経由で統一 (ADR-003)
**Factory パターン**: React コールバック注入 (ADR-005)

**データフロー**:
1. ExportButton クリック → Hook → Controller → Interactor
2. Interactor → Repository.getAll() → Background Script → IndexedDB
3. Interactor: JSON構築(メタデータ + ルール配列)
4. Interactor → Presenter → View: ファイルダウンロード実行

**新規クラスのみ作成。既存のgetAll()フローを再利用。**
end note

@enduml
